#: src/quiet-recipes.md:76
msgid ""
"`just` normally prints error messages when a recipe line fails. These error "
"messages can be suppressed using the `[no-exit-message]`<sup>1.7.0</sup> "
"attribute on individual recipes, or module-wide with `set no-exit-"
"message`<sup>1.39.0</sup>. You may find this especially useful with a recipe "
"that wraps a tool:"
msgstr ""

#: src/quiet-recipes.md:93
msgid ""
"Add the attribute to suppress the exit error message when the tool exits "
"with a non-zero code:"
