#: src/strings.md:100
msgid ""
"This expansion is performed at compile time, so variables from `.env` files "
"and exported `just` variables cannot be used. However, this allows shell "
"expanded strings to be used in places like settings and import paths, which "
"cannot depend on `just` variables and `.env` files."
